  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If average depth of an ocean is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4000</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> and the bulk modulus of water is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, then fractional compression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></math> of water at the bottom of ocean is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi></math> is _______, (Given, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mi>ρ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn><mo> </mo><mi>kg</mi><mo> </mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>)</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The formula to calculate the Bulk modulus is given by</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>From equation (1), the fractional compression in volume may be obtained as follows:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>Δ</mi><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow><mi>B</mi></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>ρ</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>∆</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mi>B</mi></mfrac><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mn>2</mn></mfenced></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>From equation (2) it follows that</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtable columnalign=\"right center left\" columnspacing=\"0px\"><mtr><mtd><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></mtd><mtd><mo>=</mo></mtd><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mn>1000</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4000</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd></mtd><mtd><mo>⇒</mo></mtd><mtd><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mo>∆</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><mi>V</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mtd></mtr></mtable></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>.</p>",
    "image": null
  },
